    "text": "If matrix $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc}3 & -2 & 4 \\\\ 1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]$ and $A^{-1}=\\frac{1}{k} \\operatorname{adj}(A)$, then $k$ is",
